      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Immaculate `A` rated three-bedroom semi-detached with attic conversion extending to approx. 112 sq.m\n• Accommodation comprises hallway, guest w.c., living room, kitchen/dining/lounge area, utility room, three bedrooms, en-suite and family bathroom and converted attic room. \n• Smart / eco features including solar panels, air ventilation system, smart heating, the house is wired for fiber broad band / TV so no need for an aerial dish. The house is wired for electric charging ready to be installed.\n• Excellent standard of finish with cobble lock driveway, engineered oak flooring, wall panelled hallway, bespoke integrated cabinetry and shelving units, marble tiles are a few of the many attributes that make this an attractive home \n• Castlefarm is situated within short walk of Naas town centre, with all amenities including shops, shopping centres, schools (both primary and secondary), pubs, restaurants, parks, playgrounds, sports and leisure clubs are close at hand\n• Excellent transport links with Sallins Arrow train service. M7 provides three lane carriageways to the M50 and all major road networks. Regular bus services are available from the main street to Dublin city centre and Dublin airport\n\nGuide Price\n425,000 \n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nCobble lock driveway, ample parking for two cars.\n\nEntrance Hallway 4.93m x 1.88m \nWhite washed engineered oak floor, wall panelling, recessed storage space under stairs.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.83m x 1.70m\nTiled floor, w.c., w.h.b.\n\nLiving Room 4.37m x 3.76m\nWhite washed engineered oak floor, bespoke built-in TV unit with cabinets, shelving and integrated electric fire.\n\nKitchen/Dining/ Lounge 6.14m x 5.67m\nWhite washed engineered oak floor, fully fitted kitchen, stone worktop, integrated fridge freezer, dishwasher, gas hob, electric oven, splash back tiles, down lights, French door to rear garden, feature wall panelling. \n\nUtility Room 3.76m x 1.50m\nPanelling, plumbed for washing machine, space for a dryer, fitted shelving, door access to side of property.\n\nLanding & Stairs 3.90m x 1.47m\nFeature carpet runner on a hardwood stairs, carpeted landing, stairs to attic conversion with en-suite,\n\nMaster Bedroom 4.40m x 3.04m\nWhite washed engineered oak floor, feature wood panel wall, fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite 2.16m x 1.28m\nTiled floor, wall partially tiled with metro tile, shower enclosure with marble tiles, power shower, w.c., w.h.b, integrated lighting.\n\nBedroom 2 4.20m x 3.14m\nWhite washed engineered oak floor, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 3.81m x 3.14m\nWhite washed engineered oak floor, integrated shelving.\n\nBathroom 1.70m x 2.21m \nTiled floor with marble and metro style wall tiles, bath with gravity fed power shower, w.c., w.h.b, with soft close vanity unit, towel radiator.\n\nAttic conversion with en-suite 3.95m x 4.68m\nFeature Velux windows, carpet, shower, tile floor, wash hand basin.\n\nGarden \nPath and seating area, lawn with panelled fencing and concrete post surround, mature shrubs and trees enhance privacy, out-door tap, side entrance.\n\nAdditional Information:\nBuilt c. 2019\nGenerous side entrance \nConverted attic \nCat 5 e-cabling & USB charging point\nCondenser gas boiler with zoned heating system \nPhotovoltaic panels \n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures and fittings, gas hob, oven, fridge, freezer, dishwasher, cooker and blinds.\n\nServices:\nMains water\nGas fired central heating\n\nBER A3\n\nViewing:\nBy appointment only.\n\nDirections:\nEircode: W91 E2RY\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright\n045 832020\n"
      },
